{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an urban legend forum, you befriended a user named &quot;Ashfall&quot; who rarely spoke\u2014until one day, Ashfall suddenly began confiding in you about the secrets of Linwood Academy: those people, that room, and... the disappearance of... &quot;her.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before you could make sense of everything, Ashfall vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to venture to Linwood Academy alone, searching for Ashfall and the truth about &quot;her.&quot; But as your investigation deepens, you discover that the secrets buried within this school are far darker than any urban legend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought you'd be facing ghosts, but the most terrifying thing has always been the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Horror Atmosphere</strong> - Immersive fear crafted through sound design, lighting, and environmental details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> - Explore the abandoned campus and use items to solve hidden mechanisms and codes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative</strong> - Piece together the complete truth from diary entries and remnants of the past</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discord Channel:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892800?t=1764599893","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892800?t=1764599893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892800/2e6f69cbb5a17c31a4a41a6ecb048404312ab075/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764599893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.